  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Search for users in Capium 365\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  4:45 PM\n\n\t\tSearching for users in Capium 365 is quick and easy. Whether updating details or checking access, this guide will help you find users fast. \n\nCapium 365\n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Manage > User\n\nTo begin, click on the search bar and enter the user’s name or email address. The system will then display the corresponding user’s details. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
